  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      427.88,
      286.55,
      612.7
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose. Description of the land or servitude to be acquired:\u2014 The following Land located in the Village of Kotuwegoda in Kotuwegoda South Grama Niladari Division (Division 01) in Matara Divisional Secretariat Division, Matara District Southern Province, dipicted as Lot No. 01 in Preliminary Plan No. MR 2566, will be acquired for the construction of quarters for the principle of St. Servaitius College matara.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.019999980926514,
      6.0,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      613.09,
      286.52,
      690.72
    ],
    "text": "Schedule 1. Lot No. 1-Name of the Land: Sinnakadirawatta; Current Land Use: Garden, Two permanent buildings, one gate, one Water tank and Cement Well; Claimant: Government; Extent: 0.0739 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.980000019073486,
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.76,
      710.83,
      286.46,
      733.44
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      330.25,
      539.49,
      433.32
    ],
    "text": "appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at the Matara Divisional Secretariat on the 16th day of July, 2015 at 10.30 a. m., and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 09th day of July 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
